  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Hola, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTengo entendido que sigues esforzándote por\nel bien de la ciudad, algo que te agradezco.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ya que estás aquí, echa un vistazo a esto,\npor favor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900610020007100750065002000650073007400E10073002000610071007500ED002C0020006500630068006100200075006E002000760069007300740061007A006F002000610020006500730074006F002C000A0070006F00720020006600610076006F0072002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué es?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E9002000650073003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Una Poké Ball?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0055006E006100200050006F006B00E9002000420061006C006C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es un Pokémon llamado Magearna, el cual fue\ncreado por los humanos hace más de 500 años.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo descubrimos durante las obras de desarrollo\nurbanístico, pero parece hallarse en estado de<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nletargo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Para despertarlo, es necesario proporcionar\nenergía a sus dispositivos internos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Algo que solo podremos hacer si disponemos\nde la Megapiedra adecuada.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C0067006F002000710075006500200073006F006C006F00200070006F006400720065006D006F007300200068006100630065007200200073006900200064006900730070006F006E0065006D006F0073000A006400650020006C00610020004D006500670061007000690065006400720061002000610064006500630075006100640061002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le pedimos a A. Z. que la creara, pero mucho me\ntemo que no pudo completar el encargo.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDe ahí que nos dispongamos en Quastelar S. A.\na retomar la labor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 160
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Serías tan amable de ayudarnos a conseguir\nlos materiales necesarios, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPrecisamos de un total de <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>999 Megaesquirlas<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Magearna se encuentra en estado de letargo.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610067006500610072006E006100200073006500200065006E006300750065006E00740072006100200065006E002000650073007400610064006F0020006400650020006C00650074006100720067006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Precisamos de un total de <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>999 Megaesquirlas<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.\n¿Podrías ayudarnos, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Has logrado reunir todas las Megaesquirlas\nque te solicité, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0048006100730020006C006F0067007200610064006F0020007200650075006E0069007200200074006F0064006100730020006C006100730020004D006500670061006500730071007500690072006C00610073000A00710075006500200074006500200073006F006C006900630069007400E9002C00200010000201000000003F001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí, aquí tienes",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300ED002C002000610071007500ED0020007400690065006E006500730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aún no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100FA006E0020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vaya, pensé que ya las tendrías.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006100790061002C002000700065006E007300E900200071007500650020007900610020006C00610073002000740065006E0064007200ED00610073002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Has entregado 999 Megaesquirlas!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100480061007300200065006E007400720065006700610064006F00200039003900390020004D006500670061006500730071007500690072006C0061007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muchísimas gracias por reunir tal cantidad.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00750063006800ED00730069006D006100730020006700720061006300690061007300200070006F00720020007200650075006E00690072002000740061006C002000630061006E00740069006400610064002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Con ellas nos encargaremos de crear la curiosa\nMegapiedra de la que te hablé.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La Megapiedra de Magearna ya está lista.\nHe aquí una Magearnita.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00610020004D0065006700610070006900650064007200610020006400650020004D00610067006500610072006E0061002000790061002000650073007400E10020006C0069007300740061002E000A00480065002000610071007500ED00200075006E00610020004D00610067006500610072006E006900740061002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por favor, emplea la Piedra Activadora del\nMegaaro para enviar energía a Magearna.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maaag...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006100610067002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Oooh, ha despertado!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004F006F006F0068002C0020006800610020006400650073007000650072007400610064006F0021001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuánto me alegro...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043007500E1006E0074006F0020006D006500200061006C006500670072006F002E002E002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por favor, muéstrale a Magearna las maravillas\ndel mundo, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F00720020006600610076006F0072002C0020006D007500E90073007400720061006C0065002000610020004D00610067006500610072006E00610020006C006100730020006D00610072006100760069006C006C00610073000A00640065006C0020006D0075006E0064006F002C00200010000201000000002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Has recibido a Magearna!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100480061007300200072006500630069006200690064006F002000610020004D00610067006500610072006E006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vaya, parece que tus cajas están llenas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006100790061002C002000700061007200650063006500200071007500650020007400750073002000630061006A00610073002000650073007400E1006E0020006C006C0065006E00610073002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuida bien de Magearna, te lo ruego.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300750069006400610020006200690065006E0020006400650020004D00610067006500610072006E0061002C0020007400650020006C006F00200072007500650067006F002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y toma también esta Megapiedra.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900200074006F006D0061002000740061006D0062006900E9006E002000650073007400610020004D006500670061007000690065006400720061002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espero que sigas cuidando de Ciudad Luminalia\ncomo hasta ahora, y <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001> también.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
